{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b5bc4016-5477-83d8-820c-a6112cafb910",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:44:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:40:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I'm calling about a water and sewer bill. My landlord says I owe it, and I'm not sure that's right. I just want to know whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:40:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can walk you through it. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:40:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "427 Gibbs Avenue, over on the Ocean Drive side. I rent the place. Fernando Cabral."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Cabral, let me pull that up. Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure. [pause] I got the bill in my hand, well, he gave me a copy of it. It says the account name is somebody else, not me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:02-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so here's how it works. The city bills the account holder on file for that property, and that's usually the owner. So the bill goes out in the owner's name. What happens between the owner and the tenant is a separate matter, usually set out in your lease."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the city's not saying I owe it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city's bill is addressed to the owner on the account. Whether the lease makes you pay him back is between you two. I'm not telling you that you do or don't, I'm just telling you who the city sent it to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but, as I said before, he told me it's mine. So which is it? Is it his bill or mine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On our end, it's his account. Your name isn't on it. If your lease says tenants cover water, he can ask you for your share, but that's a landlord and tenant thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. [sighs] I don't think I get the part about the lease. I never signed anything about water, I think. Or maybe I did. I'd have to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good thing to check. Look for anything that says utilities or water and sewer. Whatever it says is what counts between you and him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And this number here, the, uh, the usage thing. It says consumption. What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Consumption is just how much water went through the meter during the billing period. Then the charges are based on that, for the water coming in and the sewer going out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So sewer is separate from water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're two lines on the same bill. Sewer is usually figured off the water used, so they go up and down together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, I think that's, no wait. So the amount due at the bottom is both of them together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Water plus sewer, plus anything carried over from before, if there is any."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Can you send me my own copy of this? The bill. I only have his photocopy and it's cut off at the edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send a duplicate by email. Is it okay to send it to you since you're not the account holder?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm asking. I don't want it changed or anything. I just want it explained, and a clean copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Since it's a copy of the bill and not a change, I can do that. What email should I use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me think how to say it. It's my daughter set it up. [pause] Can you just use the one that's on the call notes? Or, no, you wouldn't have that. Can you take it by phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead and spell it for me slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll have to get it written down. One minute. [pause] Okay. I'll read it off the paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Funny day, by the way. An old friend called me out of the blue this morning, haven't heard from him in years. Threw me off, I've been all scattered since."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's nice, though. Okay, I've got your address and the request noted. Once you read the email I'll get that duplicate sent along today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And I'll look at the lease like you said. I still don't get all of it, but it's better than before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:43:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Call back if the lease leaves you with questions about the bill itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:44:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Tony."
    }
  ],
